!! The default route disappeared
   13:50:28 to 13:50:50  (22s)   rule default-route-lost, confidence 95%
   affected: 10.99.1.11

   1  13:50:28.343  l3.route_removed  default
      The default route was withdrawn. Nothing beyond the local segment
      is reachable from here.
      |  which caused
   2  13:50:50.423  l2.neighbor_failed  10.99.1.11
      Reachability began failing once there was no default path.

   root cause: l3.route_removed on default (confidence 95%)
   next:
      Look at the timeline immediately before this. A default route
      rarely leaves on its own; it follows an interface going down, a
      DHCP lease expiring, or a routing daemon losing its peer. Fix
      that, not the route.

